; GaiaLabs Retranslation, chapter 25. Dialogue only.

?INCLUDE 'gw82_trail_intro'
gw82_trail_intro.dialogstring_07B550! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Will]Will: This is the Great[N]Wall?[FIN]Wow. It stretches so far[N]that I can't see where it[N]ends.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'gw82_necklace_stone'
gw82_necklace_stone.dialogstring_07B611! `[CLD][DEF]A polished stone lies on[N]the ground.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@CastleV051Thought](Lance must have dropped[N]this along the way[AD])[FIN][CLD][DEF]Will picks up the stone.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'gw83_lily'
gw83_lily.dialogstring_07B6FF! `[BOR:6][DLG:3,17][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Wait![END]`
gw83_lily.dialogstring_07B709! `[BOR:6][DLG:3,15][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: You're going to[N]search for Lance, right?[FIN]I'm going too…!![END]`
gw83_lily.dialogstring_07B731! `[BOR:6][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: Eheheh. It's been[N]a long time since I've[N]borrowed your pocket like[N]this, huh?[FIN]Alright, let's go…[END]`

?INCLUDE 'sE6_gaia'
sE6_gaia.dialogstring_08E428! `[BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Gaia]The Great Wall holds[N]slopes too steep to climb[N]normally. Thy Spin Dash[N]can carry thee upward.[FIN][RET]`
sE6_gaia.dialogstring_08ECEA! `Spin Dash is a power that[N]only Will, the boy, can[N]use.[FIN]When charged, repeated[N]blocking will allow you[N]to spin and climb steep[N]inclines.`

?INCLUDE 'gw8A_sand_fanger'
gw8A_sand_fanger.dialogstring_0B80B5! `[CLD][DEF]Something gleams among[N]the remains of Sand[N]Fanger.[FIN]The legend was true.[N]Will finds a Mystic[N]Statue![END]`

?INCLUDE 'gw8B_lance_lily'
gw8B_lance_lily.dialogstring_07B824! `[CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: Lance, you idiot…[N]You had me worried…!![FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]What if the demons had[N]killed you…!![FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Lance: Sorry fer worryin'[N]everyone.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]I came here lookin' fer[N]tha Mystic Statue…[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]…but I didn't find it.[N]Will did.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]The Mystic Statue from[N]the Great Wall legend.[FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: You went there[N]alone…[FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]because of what happened[N]between us?[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Lance: …Yeah.[FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: Lance…[FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]It wasn't because of[N]Will. You just caught me[N]by surprise. I didn't[N]know what I felt.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Lance: Oh.[FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: Don't look so[N]relieved![FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]I'm still mad at you![END]`
gw8B_lance_lily.dialogstring_07BB89! `[BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: Geez…[N]He's selfish, after all…[END]`
gw8B_lance_lily.dialogstring_07B8AD! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Lance: Ah, those stones[N]are[AD][FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@CastleV051Will]Will: I found these on[N]the wall. Here you go.[WAI][CLD][PAU:3C][::][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4][SFX:0][DLY:2]Lance whispers[AD][FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4][SFX:0][DLY:2]Lance: Will[AD]won't ya leave[N]me with Lilly for just a[N]little bit?[END]`
gw8B_lance_lily.dialogstring_07B960! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4][DLY:2]Lance: I made this fer ya.[END]`
gw8B_lance_lily.dialogstring_07B9B1! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Lance: It's missin' a few[N]stones now.[FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: We followed those[N]stones, Lance. Every time[N]we found one, I knew we[N]were getting closer.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Lance: Ya followed 'em[N]all the way here?[FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: I wasn't going[N]home without you.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Lance: Well[AD] will ya take[N]it anyway?[FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: Of course I will.[FIN][CLD][DEF][SFX:0]Lance gently fastens the[N]necklace around Lilly's[N]neck.[END]`
gw8B_lance_lily.dialogstring_07BBB0! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4][DLY:0]Lance: Ah[AD][WAI][CLD][PAU:40][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2][DLY:2]Lilly: I'm not running[N]away this time.[FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2][DLY:0]Right now I still don't[N]want you looking at my[N]face.[FIN]But that's because I'm so[N]happy I'm crying.[END]`
gw8B_lance_lily.dialogstring_07BC42! `[CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: Lance[AD] From the[N]first time we met, there[N]was something about you I[N]couldn't explain.[FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Now I think I understand[N]what it was.[FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]And I know the answer I[N]wanted to give you before.[END]`
gw8B_lance_lily.dialogstring_07BCAA! `[BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly:[N][DLY:3]I care about you, too…[FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2][DLY:3][DLY:2]It would be nice if we[N]could always be together,[N]wouldn't it…?[END]`
gw8B_lance_lily.dialogstring_07BA2E! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Lance: Yahoo!![N]I've never felt like this![FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]I'm happier than the first[N]day of summer vacation![FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: *sniffle*[N]Me too.[FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Come on. Everyone's[N]probably worried about us.[END]`
